OL,3,GNEWSACampsite owner sentenced for
OL,4,Asabotaging bird scarers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA campsite owner has been sentenced
OL,7,Fafter he disarmed two bird scarer
OL,8,Fdevices he claimed were pointed at his
OL,9,Fsite to intentionally disturb his
OL,10,Fguests.
OL,12,FNigel Marsh, who runs a glamping site
OL,13,Fin Edgefield in Norfolk, removed parts
OL,14,Fof the devices to stop them from making
OL,15,Fa noise in August 2024.
OL,17,FHe has admitted criminal damage,
OL,18,Falthough a charge of theft, which he
OL,19,Fdenied, was dropped before it was due
OL,20,Fto to come to trial this week at
OL,21,FNorwich Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
