OL,4,Asabotaging bird scarers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the same court, he has been given a
OL,7,Ffour-year restraining order preventing
OL,8,Fhim from contacting his neighbours who
OL,9,Fhad the scarers on their farmland.
